<aura:documentation>
	<aura:description>
    <p>Breadcrumb Component</p>

    <!-- LAST UPDATED DATE / VERSION -->
    <p>Last Updated: 5/15/2019</p>
    <p>CurrentVersion: 2.1</p>
    <hr/>
    <!-- UPDATE DATE / VERSION WITH ANY UPDATES -->

		<p>Breadcrumb data format (v.data):</p>
<pre>
[
	{ label: 'Internal link', url: 'XX2342id' },
	{ label: 'Link to external url', url: 'Link Url' },
	...
]
</pre>
		<p>If v.onselect function is set, the redirect will be prevented, and instead the function will be called with the <code>url</code> as a parameter.</p>
    <!-- CHANGELOG ADD ANY UPDATES HERE -->
    <hr/>
    <p>Change Log</p>
		<p>1.3 - Css Update</p>
		<p>1.22 - js Update</p>
		<p>1.2 - Css Update</p>
    <p>1.1 - bug fixes</p>
    <!-- CHANGELOG -->
    <br/>
    <p>2.0 - includes page/searchParams support</p>
<pre>
[
	{ label: 'Marketplace', page: 'l2' },
	{ label: 'All Products', page: 'l2', searchParams: { type: 'product' } },
	...
]
</pre>

  </aura:description>
